              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "To log in to your **My Service Canada Account (MSCA)**, follow these official Government of Canada options and links:\n\n### 1. Access the Official Sign-In Page\nAlways ensure you are using the official, secure Government of Canada portal. You can access the main page here:\n\ud83d\udc49 **[My Service Canada Account (MSCA) Official Sign-In](https://www.canada.ca/en/employment-social-development/services/my-account.html)**\n\n---\n\n### 2. Choose Your Sign-In Method\nOnce on the official page, you will be prompted to log in using one of the following methods:\n\n*   **Option 1: GCKey**\n    *   Log in using a government-issued username and password. \n    *   If you don't have one, you can sign up for a GCKey directly on that page.\n*   **Option 2: Sign-In Partner (Interac\u00ae)**\n    *   Log in securely using your online banking credentials. \n    *   *Note: Service Canada will not see your banking details, and your bank will not receive any information about your government services.*\n*   **Option 3: Provincial Digital Identity**\n    *   If you live in **Alberta** or **British Columbia**, you can log in using your provincial digital ID (e.g., Alberta.ca Account or BC Services Card).\n\n---\n\n### 3. Requirements & Security\n*   **Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA):** To protect your personal information, MFA is mandatory for MSCA. You will be prompted to set up or enter a one-time code sent to your phone or email when logging in.\n*   **Don't have an account yet?** You will need a **Personal Access Code (PAC)** to complete your registration. If you have applied for Employment Insurance (EI) recently, this 4-digit code was mailed to you. If you do not have one, you can request a PAC online through the portal.\n\n### Services You Can Manage Once Logged In:\n*   Employment Insurance (EI)\n*   Canada Pension Plan (CPP) and Old Age Security (OAS)\n*   Canadian Dental Care Plan (CDCP)\n*   National Student Loans (NSLSC)\n*   Canada Disability Benefit (CDB)\n\n*\u26a0\ufe0f **Safety Tip:** Always double-check your browser's address bar before logging in to ensure the website address ends in **.gc.ca** or **canada.ca** to avoid phishing scams.*",
